  "value": "tickets lists flights [from, to] between three-letter uppercase airport codes; a valid itinerary using every ticket exactly once is guaranteed. Return the lexicographically smallest itinerary (airport sequence) among all valid ones. The start is the airport with one more outgoing than incoming ticket when it exists; otherwise every valid itinerary is a cycle and it starts at the smallest airport.",
